<section class="wsfilterless__s"><div class="wsfilterless__v"><div class="wsfilterless__kicker wsfilterless__c">Zdravlje psa</div><h2 class="wsfilterless__h2 wsfilterless__c">Što se mijenja kad <em>pije dvostruko više</em></h2><p class="wsfilterless__p wsfilterless__c">Vlasnici fontana bez filtera navode da psi u prvom tjednu piju dvostruko više vode. Evo što to znači.</p><div class="wsfilterless__grid wsfilterless__g4"><div class="wsfilterless__k"><div class="wsfilterless__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-bubrezi.webp' ); ?>" alt="Bubrezi koji drže korak" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wsfilterless__kt"><strong>Bubrezi koji drže korak</strong><p>Bolest bubrega jedan je od čestih uzroka smrti starijih pasa. Najčešći savjet veterinara nije lijek, nego više vode.</p></div></div><div class="wsfilterless__k"><div class="wsfilterless__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-kristali.webp' ); ?>" alt="Manje kristala" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wsfilterless__kt"><strong>Manje kristala</strong><p>Kristali nastaju u koncentriranoj mokraći. Više vode znači razrjeđeniju mokraću – a pladanj kojem se pas stalno vraća.</p></div></div><div class="wsfilterless__k"><div class="wsfilterless__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-stariji.webp' ); ?>" alt="Udobnost u starosti" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wsfilterless__kt"><strong>Udobnost u starosti</strong><p>Stariji pas koji odbija jučerašnju zdjelu i dalje će otići do pladnja sa svježom vodom.</p></div></div><div class="wsfilterless__k"><div class="wsfilterless__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-wc.webp' ); ?>" alt="Pas koji pije iz WC-a" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wsfilterless__kt"><strong>Pas koji pije iz WC-a</strong><p>Psi koji zaobilaze zdjelu i piju iz slavine ili WC-a govore vam da je ustajala voda loša. Svježa voda je ono na što prijeđu.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wsfilterless__s wsfilterless__traka wsfilterless__s--bg"><div class="wsfilterless__v wsfilterless__tmreza"><div class="wsfilterless__tk"><span class="wsfilterless__ti"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7.5 3v5.5c0 4.6-3.2 8.2-7.5 9.5-4.3-1.3-7.5-4.9-7.5-9.5V6z"/><path d="M8.6 12.2l2.4 2.4 4.4-4.6"/></svg></span><div class="wsfilterless__tt"><strong>Bez filtera, nikad</strong><span>ništa za ponovno naručivanje</span></div></div><div class="wsfilterless__tk"><span class="wsfilterless__ti"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M3 20c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.6"/><path d="M16 14.2c2.9.3 5 2.8 5 5.8"/></svg></span><div class="wsfilterless__tt"><strong>Svježa voda</strong><span>svakih 2 · 6 · 12 sati</span></div></div><div class="wsfilterless__tk"><span class="wsfilterless__ti"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 1 0 2.4-5.7"/><path d="M4 4v4.5h4.5"/><path d="M12 8v4l2.6 2"/></svg></span><div class="wsfilterless__tt"><strong>Bez kabela</strong><span>15 dana po punjenju, ispod 25 dB</span></div></div><div class="wsfilterless__tk"><span class="wsfilterless__ti"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.5" y="6" width="19" height="12" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.6"/><path d="M6 9.5v5M18 9.5v5"/></svg></span><div class="wsfilterless__tt"><strong>30 dana za povrat</strong><span>plaćanje pouzećem</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wsfilterless__s"><div class="wsfilterless__v wsfilterless__dva wsfilterless__dva--rev"><div class="wsfilterless__media"><video src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-pas-pije.mp4' ); ?>" poster="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-pas-pije.jpg' ); ?>" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"></video></div><div><div class="wsfilterless__kicker">Prvi mjesec</div><h2 class="wsfilterless__h2">Vaših prvih <em>30 dana</em> s fontanom</h2><p class="wsfilterless__p">Napravljena je da je zaboravite, a ne da njome upravljate. Ovako mjesec obično teče:</p><ol class="wsfilterless__tocke"><li><span class="wsfilterless__st">01</span><div><strong>1. dan: pet minuta</strong><p>Isperite, napunite, uključite. Pladanj se sam prazni i puni svakih 2, 6 ili 12 sati. Prvo punjenje od šest sekundi jedini je zvuk koji ćete čuti.</p></div></li><li><span class="wsfilterless__st">02</span><div><strong>3. do 7. dan: prelazak</strong><p>Psi koji su pili samo iz slavine ili WC-a prijeđu na fontanu. Unos vode otprilike se udvostruči, a staru zdjelu više ne dolijevate.</p></div></li><li><span class="wsfilterless__st">03</span><div><strong>2. tjedan: prvo ispiranje</strong><p>Ispraznite spremnik iskorištene vode, isperite pladanj, napunite čistu stranu. Oko pet minuta. Bez ružičaste sluzi i bez četke.</p></div></li><li><span class="wsfilterless__st">04</span><div><strong>4. tjedan i dalje: zaboravljena</strong><p>Jedno punjenje baterije svakih 15-ak dana. Tvrda voda? Jedan ciklus s octom svaka tri mjeseca, bez rastavljanja.</p></div></li></ol><p class="wsfilterless__zak">Veterinar pita pije li dovoljno. Ovaj put – da.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="wsfilterless__s wsfilterless__s--bg"><div class="wsfilterless__v"><div class="wsfilterless__kicker wsfilterless__c">Zašto bez filtera</div><h2 class="wsfilterless__h2 wsfilterless__c">5 razloga zašto je <em>filter morao otići</em></h2><p class="wsfilterless__p wsfilterless__c">Svaka fontana na policama dijeli istu vodu između zdjele, pumpe, filtera i psa. U tome je cijeli problem.</p><div class="wsfilterless__grid wsfilterless__g3 wsfilterless__kar"><div class="wsfilterless__k"><div class="wsfilterless__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-filter-sluz.webp' ); ?>" alt="1. Ugljeni filteri popuste za dva tjedna" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wsfilterless__kt"><strong>1. Ugljeni filteri popuste za dva tjedna</strong><p>…i onda još četiri tjedna stoje u njegovoj vodi. Ne smanjuju bakterije – nego ih udomljuju. Mi smo filter izbacili i na njegovo mjesto stavili drugi zatvoreni spremnik.</p></div></div><div class="wsfilterless__k"><div class="wsfilterless__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-pumpa.webp' ); ?>" alt="2. Pumpa nikad ne dira prljavu vodu" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wsfilterless__kt"><strong>2. Pumpa nikad ne dira prljavu vodu</strong><p>U fontani sa zajedničkom vodom pumpa stoji u dlakama, slini i mrvicama. Jeftine pumpe crknu za nekoliko mjeseci. Naša je zatvorena u čistom spremniku.</p></div></div><div class="wsfilterless__k"><div class="wsfilterless__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-pladanj-voda.webp' ); ?>" alt="3. Svježa voda po rasporedu" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wsfilterless__kt"><strong>3. Svježa voda po rasporedu</strong><p>Pladanj se potpuno isprazni i napuni iz zatvorenog spremnika svakih 2, 6 ili 12 sati. Ništa ne stoji danima. Ništa ne raste.</p></div></div><div class="wsfilterless__k"><div class="wsfilterless__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-tiha.webp' ); ?>" alt="4. Tiha i bez kabela" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wsfilterless__kt"><strong>4. Tiha i bez kabela</strong><p>Ispod 25 dB u mirovanju. USB-C, 15 dana po punjenju. Radi u spavaćoj sobi i nitko je ne primijeti – ni pas.</p></div></div><div class="wsfilterless__k"><div class="wsfilterless__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-kuciste.webp' ); ?>" alt="5. Čelik, a ne plastika" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wsfilterless__kt"><strong>5. Čelik, a ne plastika</strong><p>Pladanj od čelika 304 vadi se u jednom komadu i ispere u sekundi. Nema ogrebotina u kojima se skriva sluz.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wsfilterless__s"><div class="wsfilterless__v"><div class="wsfilterless__kicker wsfilterless__c">Usporedba</div><h2 class="wsfilterless__h2 wsfilterless__c">NORIKS AquaFresh <em>protiv fontana s filterom</em></h2><p class="wsfilterless__p wsfilterless__c">Dvije zatvorene komore umjesto jedne zajedničke zdjele vode.</p><div class="wsfilterless__tw"><table class="wsfilterless__tab"><thead><tr><th><span></span></th><th><img class="wsfilterless__thimg" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-g14.webp' ); ?>" alt="NORIKS AquaFresh" loading="eager"><span>NORIKS AquaFresh</span></th><th><img class="wsfilterless__thimg" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-filteri.webp' ); ?>" alt="Fontane s filterom" loading="eager"><span>Fontane s filterom</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Bez filtera – nikad</td><td class="wsfilterless__da">✓</td><td class="wsfilterless__ne">✕</td></tr><tr><td>Dva zatvorena spremnika</td><td class="wsfilterless__da">✓</td><td class="wsfilterless__ne">✕</td></tr><tr><td>Svježa voda svakih 2 – 12 sati</td><td class="wsfilterless__da">✓</td><td class="wsfilterless__ne">✕</td></tr><tr><td>Pumpa zatvorena u čistoj vodi</td><td class="wsfilterless__da">✓</td><td class="wsfilterless__ne">✕</td></tr><tr><td>Pladanj od nehrđajućeg čelika 304</td><td class="wsfilterless__da">✓</td><td class="wsfilterless__ne">✕</td></tr><tr><td>Ispod 25 dB, bez kabela</td><td class="wsfilterless__da">✓</td><td class="wsfilterless__ne">✕</td></tr><tr><td>Bez godišnjih troškova filtera</td><td class="wsfilterless__da">✓</td><td class="wsfilterless__ne">✕</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="wsfilterless__zak">Jednom kupite – i nikad više ne naručujete filtere.</p></div></section>
<section class="wsfilterless__s wsfilterless__s--bg"><div class="wsfilterless__v wsfilterless__dva"><div class="wsfilterless__media"><video src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-dva-psa.mp4' ); ?>" poster="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/filterless/noriks-filterless-dva-psa.jpg' ); ?>" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"></video></div><div><div class="wsfilterless__kicker">Više pasa u kući</div><h2 class="wsfilterless__h2">Dva psa. Tri psa. Četiri psa. <em>Može.</em></h2><p class="wsfilterless__p">Voda na svakom katu znači da piju više i češće, a jedna pojilica nikad ne postane nečiji teritorij.</p><p class="wsfilterless__p">Jedno punjenje zatvorenog spremnika traje nekoliko dana za jednog psa ili par dana za dva. I mali psi, mačke i kućanstva s više ljubimaca rado je koriste – samo je dolijevate rjeđe.</p><p class="wsfilterless__zak">Uz paket od 2 ili 3 fontane štedite – pogledajte ponudu gore.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="wsfilterless__s"><div class="wsfilterless__v"><div class="wsfilterless__kicker wsfilterless__c">KUPUJTE BEZ BRIGE</div><h2 class="wsfilterless__h2 wsfilterless__c">Uz NORIKS kupujete <em>bez rizika</em></h2><p class="wsfilterless__p wsfilterless__c">NORIKS AquaFresh isprobajte kod kuće. Ako vam ne odgovara, imate 30 dana za povrat – bez kompliciranja i bez pitanja.</p><div class="wsfilterless__red4 wsfilterless__pog"><div><span class="wsfilterless__pi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 1 0 2.4-5.7"/><path d="M4 4v4.5h4.5"/><path d="M12 8v4l2.6 2"/></svg></span><strong>30 dana</strong><span>za povrat novca</span></div><div><span class="wsfilterless__pi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.5h11v9h-11z"/><path d="M13.5 9.5h4l3 3.2v2.8h-7"/><circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="1.8"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.8"/></svg></span><strong>Besplatna dostava</strong><span>iznad 70 €</span></div><div><span class="wsfilterless__pi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.5" y="6" width="19" height="12" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.6"/><path d="M6 9.5v5M18 9.5v5"/></svg></span><strong>Plaćanje pouzećem</strong><span>platite kad paket stigne</span></div><div><span class="wsfilterless__pi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M3 20c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.6"/><path d="M16 14.2c2.9.3 5 2.8 5 5.8"/></svg></span><strong>120.000 kupaca</strong><span>prosječna ocjena 4,8</span></div></div></div></section>
</div>
